less the number of Unregistered Shares (as defined below), multiplied by the volume weighted daily VWAP Price over the Valuation Period.</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Unless the Valuation Date is determined by clause (c)&nbsp;of the above section entitled &#147;Valuation Date,&#148; in the event that Seller has delivered a
Registration Request at least 90 days prior to the Valuation Date (other than where the Valuation Date results from the occurrence of clause (a)&nbsp;in the definition of Registration Failure), Shares which are set forth in Pricing Date Notices that
are neither registered for resale under an effective resale Registration Statement nor transferable without any restrictions pursuant to an exemption from the registration requirements of Section&nbsp;5 of the Securities Act, including pursuant to
