<TD VALIGN="top">From time to time and on any date following the Trade Date (any such date, an &#147;<B>OET Date</B>&#148;) and subject to the terms and conditions below, Seller may, in its absolute discretion, terminate the Transaction in whole or
in part by providing written notice to Counterparty (the &#147;<B>OET Notice</B>&#148;), by the later of</TD></TR></TABLE>
