<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(c)&#8194;&#8201;&#8202;If it is, or, as a consequence of a change in law, regulation or interpretation, it becomes or
