<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left"><I><U>Affiliate Status</U></I>. It is the intention of the parties hereto that Seller shall not be an
&#147;affiliate&#148; (as such term is defined in Rule 405 under the Securities Act) of Target or Counterparty, including FLAG or Pubco, following the closing of the Business Combination, as a result of the transactions contemplated hereunder.
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
