required to register as an &#147;investment company&#148; under, and as such term is defined in, the Investment Company Act of 1940, as amended. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
