<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left"><I><U>Private Placement</U></I>. Seller (i)&nbsp;is an &#147;accredited investor&#148; as such term is defined
